WEBVTT

01:30.910 --> 01:34.979
[Legend of the Magnate]

01:35.050 --> 01:38.000
[Episode 26]

01:38.590 --> 01:39.520
We should expand

01:40.039 --> 01:41.900
our business outwards together—

01:42.950 --> 01:44.680
only this is the way to success.

01:44.710 --> 01:47.240
Why waste our efforts
in fighting each other?

01:47.350 --> 01:48.150
Cooperation?

01:49.000 --> 01:49.729
Sounds good.

01:50.039 --> 01:50.870
Let's join forces

01:50.870 --> 01:52.039
to make money from foreigners.

01:52.039 --> 01:52.610
Isn't it nice?

01:52.610 --> 01:54.229
The East India Company has monopolized

01:54.229 --> 01:55.710
the tea trade and pharmaceutical industry

01:55.710 --> 01:56.440
in East Asia.

01:56.509 --> 01:58.150
It's a business colossus.

01:58.920 --> 02:00.310
What do you think are my odds

02:00.310 --> 02:02.110
of winning if I go confront them?

02:02.150 --> 02:02.950
I'll probably

02:03.150 --> 02:04.760
be chewed up and spit out.

02:05.480 --> 02:06.790
How is it a business colossus,

02:06.790 --> 02:08.789
since it's essentially a reseller?

02:08.840 --> 02:10.560
If I were as capable as you are, Mr. Li,

02:10.560 --> 02:11.240
I would definitely

02:11.240 --> 02:12.370
fight them head-on.

02:22.360 --> 02:23.520
Or is it...

02:25.150 --> 02:26.680
that you're losing courage

02:27.310 --> 02:28.710
as you're getting older?

02:30.120 --> 02:30.960
I have an idea—

02:31.800 --> 02:33.730
to incite the tiger to eat the wolf.

02:34.560 --> 02:37.360
That is,
to pit the foreigners against each other.

02:43.360 --> 02:45.000
Old Master Hu should be awake now,
after sleeping

02:45.000 --> 02:46.530
for a day and a night, right?

02:48.400 --> 02:50.630
It no longer matters if he's awake or not.

02:50.630 --> 02:51.630
The majority of the tea merchants

02:51.630 --> 02:52.910
are now waiting outside

02:52.910 --> 02:54.510
for a conversation with you.

02:56.400 --> 02:57.520
Bypassing the tea merchants' association

02:57.520 --> 02:59.400
to purchase tea leaves
from sellers one by one

02:59.400 --> 03:00.730
is by no means possible.

03:01.120 --> 03:03.200
Now that Old Master Hu is sick,

03:03.430 --> 03:04.690
we should go visit him.

03:05.910 --> 03:06.470
Son!

03:08.400 --> 03:08.930
Let's go.

03:14.710 --> 03:16.750
Good morning, Old Master Li.

03:21.840 --> 03:23.440
Mr. Li is going to visit

03:23.470 --> 03:24.730
the sick Old Master Hu.

03:25.030 --> 03:26.090
Let's all join him.

03:26.360 --> 03:28.030
Let's go.

03:29.590 --> 03:31.320
Don't forget what we agreed on.

03:31.630 --> 03:33.190
We must not tolerate it If Old Master Hu

03:33.190 --> 03:34.800
still stubbornly sticks to his opinion.

03:34.800 --> 03:35.930
This issue concerns

03:35.960 --> 03:36.710
your lives and wealth.

03:36.710 --> 03:37.240
Got it.

03:37.360 --> 03:38.060
Smarten up.

03:38.150 --> 03:39.120
Sure, sure.

03:39.280 --> 03:41.280
I'll make proper arrangements now.

03:43.030 --> 03:45.000
[Detachment]

03:47.079 --> 03:47.630
Sir...

03:47.710 --> 03:49.110
Send a message upstairs.

03:49.390 --> 03:51.310
Just say Master Li Wantang
from the capital

03:51.310 --> 03:53.000
is here to visit Old Master Hu.

03:53.710 --> 03:54.310
Everyone,

03:54.710 --> 03:55.370
let's go in.

03:55.800 --> 03:56.990
Hold on, please!

03:57.079 --> 03:59.079
Allow me to notify the master first.

04:00.030 --> 04:01.030
Come here, you.

04:01.750 --> 04:02.630
What are you doing?

04:02.630 --> 04:04.120
Cut this crap out!

04:04.400 --> 04:05.630
Let's invite Mr. Li in.

04:05.630 --> 04:06.560
Come on.

04:08.680 --> 04:09.280
Master.

04:22.040 --> 04:23.040
Keep up.

04:23.330 --> 04:24.330
This is

04:24.360 --> 04:25.360
all thanks to you.

04:25.360 --> 04:26.360
Don't mention it.

04:28.680 --> 04:30.190
Master Li, your presence here

04:30.190 --> 04:31.100
is truly...

04:31.240 --> 04:32.240
The visitor should call on the host first.

04:32.240 --> 04:33.320
That's the rule.

04:33.360 --> 04:34.630
Old Master Hu, upon hearing

04:34.630 --> 04:35.630
about your ailments,

04:35.630 --> 04:37.159
I decided to pay you a visit.

04:37.870 --> 04:39.330
Shall we sit down and talk?

04:39.800 --> 04:41.930
Let me introduce you to a new friend...

04:42.000 --> 04:43.490
No need, Old Master Hu.

04:43.830 --> 04:46.030
You must be Li Million from the capital.

04:46.070 --> 04:47.360
I've heard much about you.

04:47.360 --> 04:48.600
My surname is Wu.

04:48.720 --> 04:49.780
I'm from Hangzhou.

04:52.430 --> 04:54.090
Wu Caishen, the God of Wealth!

04:54.740 --> 04:56.590
[Top Tea Under Heaven]

04:55.070 --> 04:56.530
Please don't call me that.

04:56.870 --> 04:58.750
I'm only running a small bank.

04:57.100 --> 05:00.650
[A businessman from Zhejiang, Wu Caishen]

04:59.040 --> 05:00.000
My friends gave me

05:00.000 --> 05:01.240
that nickname as a compliment.

05:01.240 --> 05:02.770
I dare not answer to it.

05:02.950 --> 05:03.510
Come on.

05:03.600 --> 05:04.810
Take a seat.

05:05.070 --> 05:05.570
What?

05:05.750 --> 05:07.600
Mr. Wu, do you plan to venture

05:07.680 --> 05:08.740
into tea business?

05:09.040 --> 05:10.500
I don't have what it takes.

05:11.120 --> 05:12.870
I'm a silk merchant.

05:13.160 --> 05:14.920
This time, I'm just helping a friend

05:14.920 --> 05:16.190
to transport tea leaves.

05:16.190 --> 05:16.790
That's why

05:17.070 --> 05:18.360
I'm here asking Old Master Hu

05:18.360 --> 05:19.190
for a favor.

05:19.190 --> 05:20.560
Well, I'm so flattered.

05:20.630 --> 05:21.690
What kind of favor?

05:22.270 --> 05:24.040
Who has so big an appetite

05:24.190 --> 05:25.650
to take all the tea leaves

05:25.720 --> 05:27.380
of the entire Anhui province?

05:30.270 --> 05:31.200
Mr. Wu, may I ask

05:31.510 --> 05:33.040
who is this friend of yours?

05:33.390 --> 05:35.270
How is he qualified to fight Mr. Li

05:35.270 --> 05:36.630
over Anhui tea leaves?

05:38.750 --> 05:39.680
To be honest,

05:39.950 --> 05:40.750
I've never met

05:41.270 --> 05:42.560
this man in person.

05:42.920 --> 05:44.830
Despite all that, he and I have been

05:44.830 --> 05:46.290
in contact for a long time.

05:46.390 --> 05:48.560
I've heard positive comments about him

05:48.560 --> 05:49.920
from many of my friends.

05:50.560 --> 05:51.270
So, this time,

05:51.270 --> 05:52.540
I'm happy to be of help

05:52.680 --> 05:53.710
to him.

05:53.830 --> 05:55.040
As for his name...

05:57.480 --> 05:58.870
I have such a bad memory.

05:58.920 --> 06:00.430
A carrier pigeon
brought me a note yesterday.

06:00.430 --> 06:02.040
I recorded the content on my fan.

06:02.040 --> 06:03.100
Let me check it out.

06:07.190 --> 06:09.910
By order of Mr. Gu Pingyuan,

06:09.950 --> 06:11.950
head
of Shanxi Merchants' Association,

06:11.950 --> 06:13.240
silver bullion is needed

06:13.240 --> 06:15.310
for the purchase of all the spring tea
that can be offered

06:15.310 --> 06:16.830
by Anhui Tea Merchants' Association,

06:16.830 --> 06:18.480
which shall be sent by sea

06:18.510 --> 06:20.550
to Huating Shiliupu Pier.

06:20.830 --> 06:23.240
Dear friend,
please help with it in your capacity.

06:23.240 --> 06:25.190
I will thank you in person.

06:27.680 --> 06:28.830
This good friend of mine

06:28.830 --> 06:30.720
is the most influential tea merchant
in Shanxi.

06:30.720 --> 06:31.510
I wonder...

06:32.409 --> 06:34.670
if he's qualified to make this purchase.

06:38.070 --> 06:39.240
He's from the Eight Families.

06:39.240 --> 06:40.700
A prominent figure as he is

06:40.870 --> 06:43.000
even sells tea leaves
to as far as Mongolia.

06:43.000 --> 06:45.200
He's certainly qualified for the deal.

06:45.490 --> 06:46.350
Mr. Wu, have you

06:46.680 --> 06:48.740
already transported the tea leaves?

06:50.190 --> 06:52.070
I wouldn't dare to postpone it, would I?

06:52.070 --> 06:53.560
Of course it has been done.

06:55.950 --> 06:56.510
Alright.

06:57.310 --> 06:58.120
Go on with your talk.

06:58.120 --> 06:59.510
I'm heading to Shiliupu Pier

06:59.510 --> 07:00.560
to check things out.

07:00.560 --> 07:01.240
Wait.

07:01.270 --> 07:01.950
Stay for...

07:03.430 --> 07:04.950
Something seems off.

07:05.800 --> 07:07.090
Why must the tea leaves

07:07.160 --> 07:08.890
be delivered to Shiliupu Pier?

07:09.430 --> 07:11.490
For a business deal with foreigners?

07:11.720 --> 07:13.920
Isn't it a blatant violation of the law

07:13.950 --> 07:15.280
of the Qing government?

07:16.560 --> 07:17.190
Master,

07:17.630 --> 07:18.360
let's inform

07:18.390 --> 07:19.920
the Shanghai authorities.

07:20.750 --> 07:22.190
Such disrespect to the law

07:22.190 --> 07:23.240
of the imperial court

07:23.240 --> 07:24.160
is outrageous!

07:32.430 --> 07:33.760
Thank you for saving me.

07:34.159 --> 07:35.250
I feel so honored.

07:35.390 --> 07:36.290
I hope one day

07:36.430 --> 07:37.380
I can go to India

07:37.580 --> 07:38.830
with you, Captain.

07:38.830 --> 07:40.480
It's a real honor to have your support
this time.

07:40.480 --> 07:41.510
And... they would like

07:41.510 --> 07:42.480
to go to India

07:42.510 --> 07:43.560
with you together.

07:43.560 --> 07:44.390
Come to India?

07:44.920 --> 07:46.180
What a wonderful idea.

07:46.600 --> 07:47.040
Sir,

07:47.040 --> 07:49.270
I understand
that you believe this transaction...

07:49.270 --> 07:49.950
The captain is saying

07:49.950 --> 07:52.350
that your visit to India
is warmly welcome,

07:52.800 --> 07:54.430
and that he appreciates the generous

07:54.430 --> 07:55.340
shipping payment

07:55.340 --> 07:56.830
you've offered.

07:58.040 --> 07:59.390
He hopes to repay your kindness

07:59.390 --> 08:00.050
someday.

08:00.310 --> 08:01.110
Tell him this:

08:01.510 --> 08:02.920
as an old Chinese saying goes,

08:02.920 --> 08:04.920
"reciprocity is always expected."

08:05.070 --> 08:05.920
If possible,

08:06.430 --> 08:08.490
we would very much like to do business

08:09.120 --> 08:10.900
in the UK and other countries.

08:11.680 --> 08:12.810
We hope that one day,

08:12.950 --> 08:14.770
we can afford a large ship

08:14.920 --> 08:15.800
and bring him over

08:15.800 --> 08:17.000
with it for a fun trip,

08:17.000 --> 08:18.000
after he retires.

08:18.750 --> 08:20.770
Chinese people say,

08:20.830 --> 08:22.660
"it's impolite not to return..."

08:22.660 --> 08:23.660
This black liquid

08:23.830 --> 08:24.830
tastes weird.

08:24.950 --> 08:26.610
Pretend to have got used to it.

08:27.160 --> 08:28.430
This is killing me.

08:28.920 --> 08:30.550
Don't they have tea here?

08:31.670 --> 08:32.960
British people drink tea

08:32.960 --> 08:33.840
with milk.

08:33.909 --> 08:35.770
That'll make you feel even worse.

08:38.320 --> 08:39.200
Captain!

08:39.559 --> 08:40.289
If I may...

08:40.630 --> 08:41.320
I must interrupt

08:41.320 --> 08:43.720
your conversation
with these two Chinese gentlemen.

08:43.720 --> 08:44.000
Sir,

08:44.550 --> 08:45.700
you come here for?

08:46.150 --> 08:46.840
Who is that?

08:48.360 --> 08:50.200
Mr. Hart, from the customs office.

08:50.200 --> 08:51.060
He's saying...

08:51.510 --> 08:52.360
that you, Mr. Gu, are

08:52.360 --> 08:53.550
doing business with foreign merchants

08:53.550 --> 08:55.000
against the imperial court's orders.

08:55.000 --> 08:55.960
The customs office

08:55.960 --> 08:56.910
will not let this ship

08:56.910 --> 08:57.740
set sail.

08:59.600 --> 09:01.400
This foreigner must be anxious,

09:01.430 --> 09:02.960
for trying to halt our ship.

09:02.960 --> 09:03.960
This is a warship.

09:04.150 --> 09:06.210
How is he able to stop it from sailing?

09:07.130 --> 09:07.750
If I may...

09:09.480 --> 09:10.270
Mr. Gu,

09:11.270 --> 09:12.600
you truly excel in

09:12.600 --> 09:13.660
devising schemes.

09:14.840 --> 09:15.960
You've even tricked the customs office

09:15.960 --> 09:17.020
of the Qing Empire.

09:18.670 --> 09:19.360
I can't believe

09:19.360 --> 09:21.200
this foreigner is so fluent in Mandarin!

09:21.200 --> 09:22.870
You smell of vinegar.

09:23.240 --> 09:24.170
There's no doubt

09:24.840 --> 09:26.640
that you're a rustic Shanxi man.

09:27.550 --> 09:28.640
I-I...

09:28.670 --> 09:30.750
He's probably a better debater than you.

09:30.750 --> 09:31.680
Gu Pingyuan,

09:32.030 --> 09:33.320
Do you admit your guilt?

09:33.320 --> 09:33.970
Sir,

09:34.480 --> 09:35.780
what am I guilty of?

09:36.520 --> 09:38.050
Come with me. I'll tell you.

09:42.600 --> 09:43.330
Gu Pingyuan.

09:43.960 --> 09:45.840
I'm an official of the Qing Empire.

09:45.840 --> 09:46.700
Do you admit it?

09:48.320 --> 09:49.150
Of course I do.

09:51.270 --> 09:52.470
Greetings, Mr. Hart.

09:55.910 --> 09:56.510
Sir,

09:56.960 --> 09:57.750
did you drag me here

09:57.750 --> 09:59.390
just to assert your authority?

09:59.390 --> 10:00.850
This is your last warning.

10:00.890 --> 10:03.080
A family has its rules,
and so does a country.

10:03.080 --> 10:05.680
You've offended the law
of the imperial court.

10:05.980 --> 10:06.500
What?

10:06.910 --> 10:09.510
Are you done doing business
in the Qing Empire?

10:10.910 --> 10:11.510
Sir,

10:12.000 --> 10:12.870
I don't get it.

10:13.550 --> 10:14.750
Please enlighten me.

10:15.870 --> 10:16.930
All the tea leaves,

10:16.960 --> 10:18.550
medicine, porcelain, and silk

10:18.550 --> 10:20.610
exported by the Qing customs office

10:20.670 --> 10:22.550
are procured and sold
by the imperial court.

10:22.550 --> 10:23.630
This practice began

10:23.630 --> 10:24.550
in the Ming Dynasty.

10:24.550 --> 10:27.080
It has lasted for hundreds of years,
and still persists in the Qing Empire.

10:27.080 --> 10:28.120
The trade used to be handled

10:28.120 --> 10:30.120
by the Guangzhou 13 Trading Houses.

10:30.120 --> 10:31.840
But due to the chaos in Jiangnan,

10:31.840 --> 10:32.550
the imperial court

10:32.550 --> 10:34.480
has allowed designated personnel

10:34.670 --> 10:36.720
to make transactions
with foreign merchants in Shanghai.

10:36.720 --> 10:37.880
I've never heard of

10:37.910 --> 10:39.080
an individual businessman making deals

10:39.080 --> 10:40.080
with foreigners.

10:40.240 --> 10:41.770
If you insist on doing this,

10:42.150 --> 10:43.210
the customs office

10:43.390 --> 10:44.240
will arrest you,

10:44.240 --> 10:45.320
beat you in the butt,

10:45.320 --> 10:46.500
and behead you.

10:46.750 --> 10:48.030
Sir, a man of limited talent though I am,

10:48.030 --> 10:49.030
I've read a bit about

10:49.030 --> 10:51.030
the Elements of International Law.

10:51.030 --> 10:52.360
Imagine this scenario:

10:52.440 --> 10:54.170
Mr. Hart, suppose you bought

10:54.270 --> 10:55.510
a piece of porcelain

10:55.790 --> 10:57.670
from a Chinese merchant in private

10:57.670 --> 10:59.550
before returning to your homeland,

10:59.550 --> 11:01.030
would this Chinese merchant

11:01.030 --> 11:02.270
who made a transaction

11:02.270 --> 11:03.600
with you be prosecuted?

11:03.790 --> 11:05.590
No. That was a private purchase.

11:05.750 --> 11:07.320
Even if it were 1,000 or 10,000 pieces
of porcelain,

11:07.320 --> 11:08.150
the deal was still fine.

11:08.150 --> 11:09.510
That solves the problem here, right?

11:09.510 --> 11:10.630
The tea leaves in this ship

11:10.630 --> 11:11.450
were bought

11:11.480 --> 11:13.340
by the captain from us in private.

11:13.480 --> 11:14.000
Here.

11:14.150 --> 11:14.960
Take a look.

11:15.910 --> 11:17.370
We even signed a contract.

11:18.750 --> 11:20.850
Everything's clearly stated in it.

11:20.710 --> 11:23.520
[Tea Business Operative Trade Contract]

11:21.720 --> 11:23.250
So, this deal falls outside

11:23.680 --> 11:25.510
the purview of the customs office.

11:25.510 --> 11:26.390
As for whom the captain

11:26.390 --> 11:28.120
would like to invite for a trip,

11:28.200 --> 11:29.790
it's even further beyond your authority.

11:29.790 --> 11:30.520
Gu Pingyuan,

11:31.000 --> 11:32.830
you're playing games with me.

11:32.960 --> 11:34.660
It's only a clever turn of phrase.

11:34.660 --> 11:35.720
This barely means anything.

11:35.720 --> 11:36.720
Why does a captain

11:36.750 --> 11:38.280
need these many tea leaves?

11:38.390 --> 11:38.910
No.

11:39.080 --> 11:39.810
Sir, you see,

11:40.150 --> 11:41.000
these tea leaves

11:41.000 --> 11:42.600
have been through
customs clearance and tax payment.

11:41.210 --> 11:43.020
[Tea Business Operative Trade Contract]

11:42.960 --> 11:44.420
As for the trading volume—

11:44.870 --> 11:45.930
it's not specified

11:45.960 --> 11:47.720
in the law of the imperial court.

11:47.720 --> 11:48.790
You're taking advantage

11:48.790 --> 11:50.420
of legal loopholes.

11:50.510 --> 11:51.790
If others follow suit and sell

11:51.790 --> 11:52.670
tea leaves like you do,

11:52.670 --> 11:54.200
how should I deal with that?

11:54.950 --> 11:55.550
Sir,

11:55.870 --> 11:57.330
why not take a closer look?

12:01.840 --> 12:02.700
Read this part.

12:03.150 --> 12:04.320
The selling of this batch

12:04.320 --> 12:06.050
of tea leaves was made in Anhui.

12:06.320 --> 12:07.980
What does it have to do with us?

12:08.150 --> 12:08.910
I also know a bit

12:08.910 --> 12:10.010
about British law.

12:10.120 --> 12:11.720
Free trade is allowed there.

12:12.200 --> 12:13.470
The captain can do

12:13.600 --> 12:15.200
whatever business he wants.

12:15.270 --> 12:16.470
Have I got the message

12:16.870 --> 12:18.200
across to you, sir?

12:19.960 --> 12:21.620
This contract can't be valid.

12:21.720 --> 12:23.790
He'd sign it if you offered him 10 pounds.

12:23.790 --> 12:25.150
I-I'm going to sue him!

12:25.200 --> 12:25.720
Okay!

12:26.000 --> 12:27.000
Take him to court!

12:29.960 --> 12:30.820
My dear friend,

12:31.080 --> 12:32.740
let's talk this out.

12:32.910 --> 12:35.680
Can you just cancel

12:36.030 --> 12:36.790
this deal?

12:39.200 --> 12:40.060
"Dear friend"?

12:40.960 --> 12:41.890
A friend of mine,

12:42.270 --> 12:43.600
who you met at my place previously,

12:43.600 --> 12:44.630
is the procurement agent of tea leaves

12:44.630 --> 12:45.870
for the East India Company.

12:45.870 --> 12:46.870
He deeply regrets

12:47.120 --> 12:48.360
saying

12:48.390 --> 12:50.250
something disrespectful to you.

12:50.390 --> 12:51.000
What

12:51.030 --> 12:52.120
disrespectful things?

12:52.120 --> 12:53.320
He took money from Li Million.

12:53.320 --> 12:54.450
The latter told him

12:54.720 --> 12:56.270
that they could rake in more profits

12:56.270 --> 12:57.030
from Anhui tea

12:57.030 --> 12:58.510
if they ganged up on you tea merchants.

12:58.510 --> 12:59.720
But little did everyone

12:59.720 --> 13:01.030
expect that you could find a way

13:01.030 --> 13:01.910
to sell the tea leaves

13:01.910 --> 13:02.970
directly to India.

13:03.080 --> 13:03.630
If...

13:03.790 --> 13:05.120
If the tea leaves truly arrive in India,

13:05.120 --> 13:06.910
won't it be a giant slap
in the agent's face?

13:06.910 --> 13:07.600
He spent

13:07.630 --> 13:09.360
spent most of his life climbing

13:09.440 --> 13:10.840
to his current position.

13:11.320 --> 13:12.570
He can assure you

13:12.790 --> 13:13.720
that from now on,

13:13.870 --> 13:15.080
he'll purchase Anhui tea leaves

13:15.080 --> 13:16.610
at the best price possible.

13:17.270 --> 13:19.170
You must not set a precedent.

13:19.240 --> 13:20.320
This batch of tea leaves

13:20.320 --> 13:20.870
is no big deal.

13:20.870 --> 13:23.580
But shipping it
will destroy his reputation

13:23.750 --> 13:24.750
and career.

13:25.240 --> 13:26.080
But I'm only

13:26.120 --> 13:27.250
a tiny tea merchant.

13:27.790 --> 13:28.910
I don't represent the court,

13:28.910 --> 13:29.480
nor do I lead

13:29.480 --> 13:30.720
some tea merchants' association.

13:30.720 --> 13:32.430
Can my words make any difference?

13:32.430 --> 13:33.390
My dear friend,

13:34.410 --> 13:36.080
don't make things hard for me.

13:36.080 --> 13:36.870
Take it as a win.

13:36.870 --> 13:38.550
Don't push me any further.

13:39.270 --> 13:40.330
As the saying goes,

13:40.840 --> 13:42.630
you scratch my back,

13:42.670 --> 13:44.470
and I scratch yours.

13:44.510 --> 13:45.240
Right?

13:47.080 --> 13:47.820
Sir, I...

13:47.870 --> 13:49.510
I admire how articulate you are

13:49.510 --> 13:50.510
even in Mandarin.

13:50.840 --> 13:51.700
How about this?

13:53.200 --> 13:54.500
Tell your good friend

13:54.840 --> 13:56.720
that I'd include him in this deal.

13:57.030 --> 13:58.030
He can go to India

13:58.030 --> 13:58.960
with this shipment.

13:58.960 --> 13:59.520
However,

13:59.720 --> 14:01.750
don't even think about the dividends.

14:01.750 --> 14:02.440
When we have

14:02.480 --> 14:03.520
our own ship

14:03.790 --> 14:04.450
and expand

14:04.480 --> 14:05.910
our tea business worldwide,

14:05.910 --> 14:06.640
maybe we will

14:06.910 --> 14:08.440
let him join us as a partner.

14:09.960 --> 14:11.420
What a satisfying answer.

14:12.080 --> 14:12.860
Good.

14:13.270 --> 14:13.870
Later on,

14:14.270 --> 14:15.750
sign a contract with him.

14:16.600 --> 14:17.240
My friend,

14:17.910 --> 14:19.690
if you were a British merchant,

14:20.000 --> 14:20.910
I would really quit

14:20.910 --> 14:22.360
my job at the customs office

14:22.360 --> 14:23.550
and work as your partner.

14:23.550 --> 14:25.150
We would be rolling in money.

14:25.480 --> 14:28.410
Why can't that come true
when I'm a Chinese merchant?

14:28.440 --> 14:30.270
In the face of such powerful cannons,

14:30.270 --> 14:31.840
the oriental cleverness

14:31.910 --> 14:33.030
is useless.

14:37.120 --> 14:38.320
I have to remind you.

14:39.240 --> 14:40.960
Some people from your hometown

14:40.960 --> 14:41.820
have come here.

14:55.110 --> 15:03.910
[Shiliupu Pier]

15:04.550 --> 15:05.270
Mr. Gu!

15:06.320 --> 15:06.910
Buddy.

15:09.910 --> 15:11.440
It's a pleasure to meet you.

15:11.670 --> 15:13.120
You're a true friend in need.

15:13.120 --> 15:14.120
I'm grateful for your help.

15:14.120 --> 15:15.120
Don't mention it.

15:15.440 --> 15:16.120
I didn't realize

15:16.120 --> 15:17.390
such an enormous ship exists

15:17.390 --> 15:18.920
until I reached this place.

15:20.030 --> 15:21.230
Where is your friend?

15:21.550 --> 15:22.960
He said
he'd like to explore exotic lands,

15:22.960 --> 15:25.160
so he'll stay on the ship and go to India.

15:26.200 --> 15:27.670
I'd better go say hello to him now.

15:27.670 --> 15:28.470
You guys talk.

15:29.840 --> 15:30.480
Mr. Gu,

15:30.870 --> 15:32.200
the Tea Merchants' Association

15:32.200 --> 15:33.050
has escaped danger.

15:33.050 --> 15:34.840
All the credit goes to you, Mr. Gu.

15:34.840 --> 15:35.900
We're like family.

15:35.910 --> 15:37.390
Let's be frank with each other.

15:37.390 --> 15:39.450
I'm truly convinced of your ability.

15:41.390 --> 15:42.320
These notes were issued

15:42.320 --> 15:43.650
by the Four Major Banks.

15:44.210 --> 15:45.610
These are bills of sales.

15:46.840 --> 15:47.300
Well...

15:47.320 --> 15:48.750
Several twists in a day.

15:49.120 --> 15:50.410
If I were older,

15:50.630 --> 15:52.360
I'd be overwhelmed by you guys.

15:54.480 --> 15:55.910
New arrivals. Unload the goods!

15:55.910 --> 15:57.570
Pretend to be talking with me.

15:58.630 --> 16:00.160
Look to the east, behind me.

16:00.840 --> 16:01.770
It's Li Million.

16:02.120 --> 16:03.100
His face...

16:03.670 --> 16:04.990
Look at his face.

16:05.360 --> 16:07.560
This pleases me better than spring tea.

16:08.790 --> 16:10.840
Looks like he's about to
eat someone alive.

16:10.840 --> 16:12.640
As if he had the stomach for that.

16:25.480 --> 16:26.480
There will be a day

16:27.320 --> 16:28.650
when I buy a large ship

16:30.120 --> 16:31.650
and extend our tea business

16:32.080 --> 16:33.410
to the whole wide world.

16:43.360 --> 16:44.490
Are you Gu Pingyuan?

16:45.190 --> 16:46.360
We're from the Bureau of Foreign Affairs.

16:46.360 --> 16:47.390
Come with us!

17:16.720 --> 17:17.589
How is it?

17:17.589 --> 17:18.790
Not as good as coffee.

17:31.350 --> 17:32.210
What happened?

17:32.510 --> 17:33.480
The Shanghai Bureau of Foreign Affairs

17:33.480 --> 17:36.280
has notified the customs office
to halt this ship.

17:55.920 --> 17:56.510
Captain.

17:59.510 --> 18:01.190
As this is a trade dispute,

18:01.240 --> 18:03.160
I will not interfere
or get involved in any way.

18:03.160 --> 18:03.710
This is

18:03.790 --> 18:05.270
defined as a trade dispute.

18:05.270 --> 18:06.470
The captain is saying

18:06.480 --> 18:08.440
that in principal, he won't intervene,

18:08.440 --> 18:10.310
so as to avoid any impacts on his job

18:10.310 --> 18:10.970
and career.

18:11.240 --> 18:11.880
Well...

18:12.590 --> 18:13.590
What does it mean?

18:13.880 --> 18:15.940
It means we're in a tricky situation.

18:16.000 --> 18:17.530
The only way to resolve this

18:17.590 --> 18:19.590
is to have it all dumped into the sea.

18:19.790 --> 18:20.830
What did he say now?

18:20.830 --> 18:21.630
He ordered...

18:21.640 --> 18:22.960
to have all these troublesome tea leaves

18:22.960 --> 18:24.090
thrown into the sea.

18:24.550 --> 18:25.270
What?

18:31.240 --> 18:32.020
Stop!

18:32.400 --> 18:32.960
Stop!

18:33.000 --> 18:33.640
Tell them

18:33.680 --> 18:35.160
to stop now. Right now!

18:36.240 --> 18:37.160
Say it!

18:38.110 --> 18:39.350
Are you even Chinese?

18:41.000 --> 18:41.680
Tell them

18:42.160 --> 18:44.200
I'll bear all the consequences.

18:45.830 --> 18:46.400
Next one!

18:47.480 --> 18:47.970
Stop it!

18:48.000 --> 18:48.480
Stop!

18:48.510 --> 18:49.160
Stop it!

18:49.480 --> 18:50.000
Here.

18:50.680 --> 18:51.160
Stop it!

18:51.270 --> 18:52.070
Stop! Stop!

18:52.160 --> 18:52.720
Stop it!

18:53.110 --> 18:53.790
Stop!

18:55.270 --> 18:55.920
He said

18:56.160 --> 18:58.290
he would take all the responsibility.

18:59.920 --> 19:02.550
I don't see any man here
who can take all this responsibility.

19:02.550 --> 19:04.160
If you throw all the tea leaves
into the sea,

19:04.160 --> 19:05.590
you will be in bigger trouble!

19:05.590 --> 19:07.250
You will have bigger trouble.

19:10.590 --> 19:11.270
He's saying

19:11.590 --> 19:14.320
that if any disputes arise
in the customs office,

19:16.010 --> 19:17.590
without government orders,

19:17.590 --> 19:19.100
he won't intervene

19:19.210 --> 19:20.140
or get involved.

19:20.720 --> 19:21.920
This is only a dispute.

19:21.920 --> 19:23.880
There hasn't been a conclusion yet, right?

19:23.880 --> 19:26.310
Negotiation is needed
for every business deal.

19:26.310 --> 19:27.110
If it turns out

19:27.110 --> 19:28.350
there is no legal impropriety,

19:28.350 --> 19:30.550
you'll be held accountable
for your actions.

19:30.550 --> 19:32.510
You'll probably have to bid farewell

19:32.510 --> 19:34.200
to your ship for discarding all the goods!

19:34.200 --> 19:35.000
On top of that,

19:35.110 --> 19:36.700
you won't make a penny!

19:36.750 --> 19:38.240
You will get no money

19:38.440 --> 19:40.200
and won't see your boat anymore,

19:40.200 --> 19:42.240
due to discarding the tea.

19:43.720 --> 19:44.650
I dare say

19:44.750 --> 19:46.610
no one can guarantee me anything.

19:47.400 --> 19:49.660
He said no one could give him a guarantee.

19:49.790 --> 19:50.590
Guarantee?

19:52.470 --> 19:53.930
I can give you a guarantee.

19:54.200 --> 19:55.700
But I need two hours.

19:56.510 --> 19:58.160
If the dispute isn't resolved

19:58.160 --> 19:59.330
in two hours,

20:00.480 --> 20:01.270
I won't hold you back

20:01.270 --> 20:02.470
from doing anything.

20:03.690 --> 20:05.040
Tell him who I am.

20:05.590 --> 20:06.240
I...

20:06.590 --> 20:07.680
have traveled farther

20:07.680 --> 20:09.550
than any other tea merchant in China.

20:09.550 --> 20:10.720
My assets...

20:11.070 --> 20:11.790
are sufficient

20:11.790 --> 20:12.760
enough to pay for

20:12.790 --> 20:14.120
all the tea leaves here.

20:15.440 --> 20:16.160
But now,

20:16.200 --> 20:17.130
I need two hours.

20:17.750 --> 20:18.680
Just two hours.

20:19.750 --> 20:21.110
Tell him not to be a coward.

20:21.110 --> 20:23.510
He wishes you not to be a coward.

20:24.440 --> 20:26.170
You think I'm a big coward, huh?

20:27.720 --> 20:29.160
Seems like our friends here

20:29.160 --> 20:30.310
need a little more time

20:30.310 --> 20:31.970
to resolve this predicament.

20:32.470 --> 20:33.400
Tell all the ships

20:33.400 --> 20:34.200
to stay at bay.

20:34.870 --> 20:35.750
If they talk

20:35.750 --> 20:36.780
any more nonsense,

20:36.780 --> 20:38.480
I'll have them all sunk!

20:38.830 --> 20:39.590
Yes, sir!

20:40.290 --> 20:41.440
Bear further!

20:44.190 --> 20:45.590
I just give you two hours.

20:47.750 --> 20:48.750
Within the next two hours,

20:48.750 --> 20:49.510
that ship ahead

20:49.510 --> 20:51.000
won't come over to check the goods.

20:51.000 --> 20:51.590
However,

20:52.270 --> 20:53.870
you're only given two hours.

21:24.350 --> 21:25.150
Intendant Wu?

21:25.370 --> 21:28.450
[Outstanding Talents]

21:26.000 --> 21:27.460
This matter concerns you?

21:28.510 --> 21:30.550
I'm here to see
how things are going with my friend's

21:30.550 --> 21:31.480
small business.

21:32.150 --> 21:33.240
Small business?

21:34.550 --> 21:36.200
A British gunboat has been halted for it.

21:36.200 --> 21:37.640
You call it small business?

21:37.640 --> 21:38.640
Then what's big business,

21:38.640 --> 21:39.680
the kind that brings down

21:39.680 --> 21:41.150
the Shanghai Bureau of Foreign Affairs?

21:41.150 --> 21:42.410
[Outstanding Talents] [Morals and Ethics]

21:42.550 --> 21:43.200
Intendant Wu,

21:43.130 --> 21:44.160
[Shanghai Intendant, Liu Ruifen]

21:43.550 --> 21:44.240
Mr. Hart,

21:44.440 --> 21:45.040
be seated.

21:47.160 --> 21:48.440
As for the others, do not speak

21:48.440 --> 21:49.400
-unless you're called upon.
-Mr. Wu,

21:49.400 --> 21:50.530
you are an official?

21:51.110 --> 21:51.890
I just bought

21:51.920 --> 21:53.250
a random official post.

21:53.590 --> 21:54.850
My life's at stake now.

21:55.400 --> 21:57.240
Tell me what the Bureau
of Foreign Affairs has done—

21:57.240 --> 21:58.640
only the important part.

21:59.350 --> 22:00.550
This humble servant, Li Wantang,

22:00.550 --> 22:02.720
pays his respects to you, Intendant Liu.

22:02.720 --> 22:03.980
I have an official seal

22:04.200 --> 22:06.000
bestowed by the imperial court,

22:06.440 --> 22:07.390
which grants me the right

22:07.330 --> 22:09.440
[Approved by the Ministry of Revenue]

22:07.480 --> 22:09.410
to solely manage the export of tea.

22:09.830 --> 22:10.800
Li Wantang,

22:11.270 --> 22:12.160
you're being too modest.

22:12.160 --> 22:13.610
This young man

22:13.720 --> 22:15.780
has conspired with Shanxi merchants

22:15.960 --> 22:16.920
and secretly

22:17.110 --> 22:19.380
gone in glove with the captain

22:19.680 --> 22:21.280
of a British warship to ship

22:21.350 --> 22:22.950
tea leaves to India for sale.

22:23.350 --> 22:24.750
Isn't it against the law?

22:25.110 --> 22:26.040
Won't it turn

22:26.070 --> 22:28.400
the exclusive operating rights agreement
on tea trade

22:28.400 --> 22:29.960
between me and foreigners
into a dead letter?

22:29.960 --> 22:31.180
Intendant Liu,

22:31.790 --> 22:32.990
I beg you for justice.

22:35.110 --> 22:35.970
Intendant Liu,

22:36.480 --> 22:38.480
Mr. Hart and I just had a discussion,

22:38.590 --> 22:40.190
and he reviewed my contract.

22:40.750 --> 22:41.440
This foreigner

22:41.440 --> 22:44.070
I'm dealing with
only wants to buy some tea leaves

22:44.070 --> 22:45.200
and bring them home.

22:45.440 --> 22:46.440
Is it not allowed?

22:47.030 --> 22:48.270
Did anyone ask you to speak?

22:48.270 --> 22:49.640
Get him out and flog him!

22:50.480 --> 22:51.270
Why do you have to

22:51.270 --> 22:52.730
irritate him at this time?

22:53.440 --> 22:54.300
Intendant Liu,

22:54.720 --> 22:57.450
this young man you just lashed out at
doesn't hold

22:57.680 --> 22:58.920
an official position,

22:58.920 --> 23:00.030
but he is in fact

23:00.400 --> 23:01.600
somewhat an officer.

23:02.070 --> 23:03.660
The Empress Dowager

23:03.790 --> 23:06.130
personally appointed him to be

23:06.240 --> 23:07.960
the Pacification Commissioner of Hefei.

23:07.960 --> 23:09.710
He's no ordinary commoner.

23:10.200 --> 23:11.060
Intendant Liu,

23:11.310 --> 23:12.440
please reconsider.

23:16.340 --> 23:17.240
Keeping silent at this time

23:17.240 --> 23:18.680
is an admission of guilt, isn't it?

23:18.680 --> 23:19.880
You've been bringing

23:20.030 --> 23:21.480
trouble to the Bureau of Foreign Affairs.

23:21.480 --> 23:22.680
What is it do you want?

23:23.920 --> 23:24.920
This matter should be handled

23:24.920 --> 23:26.980
by the customs office in your charge.

23:27.070 --> 23:30.070
Indeed, the customs office
should take the lead on it.

23:30.160 --> 23:31.000
However,

23:31.510 --> 23:32.720
this young man's

23:32.750 --> 23:34.030
tea leaves

23:34.070 --> 23:36.240
were brought onto the ship in the name

23:36.240 --> 23:37.240
of a personal purchase

23:37.240 --> 23:39.280
upon completing legal procedures.

23:39.590 --> 23:41.250
I don't see any problems in it.

23:41.310 --> 23:42.810
It's just that Li Million

23:42.880 --> 23:43.940
disagrees with it.

23:44.000 --> 23:45.000
In this case,

23:45.110 --> 23:46.680
we need you to be the judge

23:46.720 --> 23:47.640
on this matter.

23:47.920 --> 23:49.050
A personal purchase

23:49.750 --> 23:51.680
of an entire province's tea leaves

23:51.790 --> 23:53.390
that can fill up a large ship?

23:53.400 --> 23:56.000
They're more than
the buyer can consume in a lifetime!

23:56.000 --> 23:57.640
You guys mean to fool us.

23:57.680 --> 23:59.480
I don't believe any of that crap!

24:01.240 --> 24:02.480
Is it how the customs office works—

24:02.480 --> 24:03.410
through tricks?

24:03.440 --> 24:04.750
I supervise the customs affairs

24:04.750 --> 24:06.280
under the imperial decree.

24:06.550 --> 24:08.160
I'm coping with Li Million

24:08.240 --> 24:10.440
and Wu Caishen at the same time.

24:10.720 --> 24:11.480
You think I can

24:11.480 --> 24:13.280
afford to offend either of them?

24:13.830 --> 24:14.550
Besides,

24:14.790 --> 24:17.830
I can't find a single mistake
in Mr. Gu's business contract

24:17.830 --> 24:19.960
signed in compliance with
the court's regulations.

24:19.960 --> 24:21.640
That's why I'm handing over this matter
to the Bureau of Foreign Affairs

24:21.640 --> 24:22.970
for you to preside over.

24:23.240 --> 24:25.390
You hold a high position.

24:25.480 --> 24:26.720
Of course you can see farther

24:26.720 --> 24:27.680
than I can.

24:28.270 --> 24:28.930
You weasel.

24:30.270 --> 24:31.310
You old weasel.

24:34.200 --> 24:35.130
Mr. Li and Mr. Gu.

24:35.270 --> 24:35.930
Gentlemen?

24:43.000 --> 24:43.800
Mr. Li, Mr. Gu,

24:44.000 --> 24:45.920
you've really put me on the spot.

24:46.880 --> 24:47.680
You see,

24:47.750 --> 24:49.550
I'm fairly new to this position.

24:49.590 --> 24:51.590
I haven't learned much about trade.

24:52.750 --> 24:53.480
Can you two

24:53.960 --> 24:55.350
both make a concession?

24:57.110 --> 24:57.970
Intendant Liu,

24:59.640 --> 25:02.880
this is a valid golden seal
issued by the Ministry of Revenue.

25:02.880 --> 25:04.720
You cannot allow
such practice to take hold.

25:04.720 --> 25:06.380
If you let them pass this time,

25:06.510 --> 25:08.240
then everyone else will follow suit

25:08.240 --> 25:09.720
and trade with foreigners directly.

25:09.720 --> 25:11.640
What will become of the country
if nobody respects the exclusive rights

25:11.640 --> 25:13.070
granted by the imperial court?

25:13.070 --> 25:14.750
Making a fair judgement on this

25:14.750 --> 25:17.010
is easing the imperial court's worries.

25:17.440 --> 25:18.300
Intendant Liu,

25:18.640 --> 25:19.790
this batch of tea leaves

25:19.790 --> 25:21.520
is indeed a personal purchase.

25:21.720 --> 25:22.920
If you don't believe it,

25:22.920 --> 25:24.200
then put the captain of that gunboat

25:24.200 --> 25:25.000
on trial

25:25.270 --> 25:26.480
in the court of law.

25:26.750 --> 25:28.420
Should he dare to lie,

25:28.680 --> 25:29.750
have him taken down

25:30.030 --> 25:30.760
and flogged.

25:30.920 --> 25:31.880
What right do I have

25:31.880 --> 25:32.680
to punish him?

25:33.590 --> 25:34.920
If another war is triggered by it,

25:34.920 --> 25:36.790
won't I be dismissed from my position?

25:36.790 --> 25:37.830
That's a point.

25:39.070 --> 25:39.640
Intendant Liu,

25:39.640 --> 25:41.720
please examine into this matter carefully.

25:41.720 --> 25:43.790
There are loopholes
in the law of the imperial court.

25:43.790 --> 25:44.830
You can't let these people

25:44.830 --> 25:46.160
take advantage of them.

25:46.550 --> 25:47.870
The position you're in requires you

25:47.870 --> 25:48.930
to uphold justice,

25:48.960 --> 25:51.020
so as to reassure the imperial court.

25:51.400 --> 25:52.680
How cunning.

25:54.160 --> 25:55.890
Can't you both take a step back,

25:56.350 --> 25:57.700
or negotiate again?

25:57.790 --> 25:58.400
Okay!

25:59.200 --> 25:59.830
Okay.

26:04.790 --> 26:05.320
Alright.

26:05.330 --> 26:07.010
It's time to stop the fuss.

26:07.270 --> 26:08.310
Why should I stop?

26:10.240 --> 26:11.560
Young man,

26:11.790 --> 26:13.450
can't you be good and grow tea?

26:14.720 --> 26:15.720
Haven't you suffered

26:15.720 --> 26:16.850
enough in Ningguta?

26:17.550 --> 26:19.210
Alright. Stop the kerfuffle.

26:19.240 --> 26:21.040
I've been pushed this far by you.

26:21.480 --> 26:23.070
It'll destroy the lives
of many Anhui tea merchants

26:23.070 --> 26:24.440
if their spring tea doesn't sell.

26:24.440 --> 26:26.040
I'll back off if you back off.

26:34.750 --> 26:35.350
Hu.

26:36.160 --> 26:37.240
Hu!

26:37.750 --> 26:38.590
Come here.

26:42.720 --> 26:43.310
Mr. Li.

26:43.920 --> 26:44.850
No need for this.

26:45.350 --> 26:47.080
Any word that is given here today

26:47.080 --> 26:48.030
must be kept.

26:48.750 --> 26:50.080
Get the tea leaves back.

26:50.240 --> 26:51.580
All Anhui spring tea

26:51.640 --> 26:53.430
will be paid at the usual price.

26:53.590 --> 26:54.200
Is it okay?

26:54.590 --> 26:55.400
About that...

26:56.130 --> 26:57.520
Mr. Gu has the final say.

27:01.450 --> 27:02.980
I'll raise the price by 10%,

27:03.120 --> 27:04.780
if you withdraw the shipment.

27:11.920 --> 27:12.720
It's too late.

27:13.000 --> 27:14.110
If I withdraw it now,

27:14.110 --> 27:16.590
I'll be condemned
as a dishonest businessman.

27:16.590 --> 27:18.290
All tea merchants in Anhui

27:18.480 --> 27:20.220
follow Mr. Gu's lead.

27:20.350 --> 27:21.270
Do you even hear

27:21.310 --> 27:22.520
what you're saying?

27:22.750 --> 27:23.480
Do you?

27:25.030 --> 27:26.480
He's just a young man,

27:26.720 --> 27:29.440
while you're head
of the Tea Merchant's Association.

27:29.440 --> 27:30.640
Which matters more, he alone

27:30.640 --> 27:32.150
or the lives of all Anhui tea merchants?

27:32.150 --> 27:33.950
Are you getting old and foolish?

27:34.830 --> 27:35.440
Mr. Li,

27:36.110 --> 27:37.380
I prioritize trust

27:37.720 --> 27:39.270
in everything I do.

27:39.830 --> 27:40.680
Let me be clear—

27:40.680 --> 27:42.200
even if Mr. Gu told

27:42.270 --> 27:43.810
all Anhui tea merchants

27:43.880 --> 27:46.030
to jump into a pit of fire now,

27:46.400 --> 27:47.200
I'd do it.

27:52.510 --> 27:53.070
Fine.

27:54.590 --> 27:56.160
Very fine.

27:58.200 --> 27:59.270
The tea can't be withdrawn now, right?

27:59.270 --> 28:00.200
If I had agreed to it,

28:00.200 --> 28:01.790
I would've fallen into his trap.

28:01.790 --> 28:02.400
Report!

28:14.550 --> 28:15.170
Are you

28:15.200 --> 28:16.460
trying to get me fired?

28:48.070 --> 28:49.590
An anti-smuggling ship
of the customs office

28:49.590 --> 28:51.160
has intercepted that warship.

28:51.160 --> 28:52.510
But the people on the warship

28:52.510 --> 28:54.160
reject any customs inspection.

28:54.160 --> 28:55.270
With the cover lifted,

28:55.270 --> 28:56.680
their cannon is ready to shoot.

28:56.680 --> 28:57.440
Now,

28:57.720 --> 28:59.300
I think we've hit the point

28:59.510 --> 29:00.550
of no return.

29:01.400 --> 29:02.180
It's all set.

29:02.310 --> 29:03.310
They'll open fire

29:04.030 --> 29:04.760
in two hours.

29:06.350 --> 29:07.000
Have you

29:07.000 --> 29:08.480
reached a conclusion yet?

29:14.720 --> 29:16.120
Intendant Liu, Mr. Hart,

29:16.480 --> 29:18.240
if you let them pass today,

29:18.350 --> 29:19.450
I will take this

29:19.480 --> 29:21.820
to the prince and the Ministry of Revenue

29:22.270 --> 29:23.400
and ask for a ruling.

29:23.440 --> 29:24.280
Fine.

29:24.720 --> 29:26.180
Ask them for a ruling then.

29:27.070 --> 29:28.320
A ruling?

29:28.890 --> 29:30.240
Once the gunboat opens fire,

29:30.240 --> 29:31.750
everyone on the anti-smuggling ship

29:31.750 --> 29:32.590
will die.

29:33.240 --> 29:33.970
This is

29:34.000 --> 29:35.640
a serious moment.

29:35.920 --> 29:37.200
Any exchange of fire will unleash hell,

29:37.200 --> 29:40.240
since they're still within the borders
of the Qing Empire.

29:40.240 --> 29:40.920
Li Million,

29:41.440 --> 29:43.170
will you take a step back or not?

29:57.590 --> 29:59.240
You seem to be more audacious
than Zhao Zilong,

29:59.240 --> 30:00.030
an ancient warrior

30:00.030 --> 30:01.360
renowned for his valor!

30:01.480 --> 30:03.160
The Bureau of Foreign Affairs
is a government office.

30:03.160 --> 30:05.270
Let's respect the golden seal
issued by the imperial court.

30:05.270 --> 30:06.090
Li Million,

30:06.440 --> 30:07.550
if you insist on halting the warship,

30:07.550 --> 30:08.720
then go ahead.

30:08.830 --> 30:09.830
Should there be serious consequences,

30:09.830 --> 30:11.200
you will answer to the Ministry of Revenue

30:11.200 --> 30:13.260
and the prince with that golden seal!

30:39.550 --> 30:42.030
Those enemy trading ships  have withdrawn!

30:42.060 --> 30:43.000
Cease fire!

30:43.310 --> 30:44.510
Cease fire!

30:44.670 --> 30:45.610
Prepare to sail!

30:45.750 --> 30:46.880
Prepare to sail!

30:51.270 --> 30:52.130
What did he say?

30:52.440 --> 30:54.570
The opposing forces' ships  have quit.

30:54.590 --> 30:55.200
Really?

30:55.350 --> 30:56.610
I'm coming down to you!

31:07.790 --> 31:09.480
This is a historic first!

31:11.440 --> 31:13.230
Congratulations in advance, Mr. Li.

31:13.230 --> 31:13.880
On what?

31:14.310 --> 31:15.240
These tea leaves

31:15.240 --> 31:16.910
will be sold at amazing prices in India.

31:16.910 --> 31:17.910
This transaction

31:18.000 --> 31:19.600
has enraged some Chinese...

31:19.940 --> 31:21.200
and also some British.

31:21.200 --> 31:24.000
Isn't it a historic first?

31:33.310 --> 31:35.410
Gu Pingyuan is truly smart.

31:36.720 --> 31:37.350
If I had known,

31:37.350 --> 31:38.770
I would've made him stay

31:39.240 --> 31:40.510
in Ningguta forever.

31:41.680 --> 31:42.440
Master,

31:43.000 --> 31:44.880
what's done can't be undone.

31:47.240 --> 31:48.270
I've raised a viper

31:48.270 --> 31:49.500
to harm myself.

31:50.480 --> 31:52.000
Every time it escapes death,

31:52.000 --> 31:53.800
its venomous fangs grow longer.

31:55.030 --> 31:57.270
It happens because of your sense of mercy.

31:57.270 --> 31:58.200
It's the first time

31:58.200 --> 32:00.060
I've been complimented that way.

32:00.070 --> 32:00.930
Think about it.

32:01.350 --> 32:02.160
Today,

32:02.270 --> 32:03.350
you could've adamantly

32:03.350 --> 32:05.200
ordered to intercept the tea leaves—

32:05.200 --> 32:07.030
all hung on a single thought of yours.

32:07.030 --> 32:08.510
If that resulted in a disaster,

32:08.510 --> 32:09.880
we could survive it,

32:10.000 --> 32:10.610
but

32:10.680 --> 32:12.510
that young man would be crushed, right?

32:12.510 --> 32:14.020
So, he's still alive now

32:14.070 --> 32:15.750
exactly because of your sense of mercy.

32:15.750 --> 32:16.770
What is mercy?

32:17.000 --> 32:18.000
What does it mean?

32:19.510 --> 32:20.960
-Madam Jin.
-Get me my jade bowls!

32:20.960 --> 32:22.920
This must be the wine

32:22.960 --> 32:24.020
you treasure most.

32:24.550 --> 32:26.880
Its aroma is seeping
out of the sealed jar.

32:30.170 --> 32:30.790
Smell it.

32:32.720 --> 32:33.880
What a lovely scent.

32:36.950 --> 32:37.950
Thank you, Madam.

32:44.680 --> 32:45.680
As the Association Head,

32:45.680 --> 32:47.010
you should drink first.

32:48.080 --> 32:48.870
Everyone,

32:49.920 --> 32:50.830
I never

32:50.880 --> 32:51.810
play by the book.

32:51.950 --> 32:52.990
I've come this far

32:53.200 --> 32:54.920
thanks to your support.

32:55.170 --> 32:56.400
Your kindness will forever

32:56.400 --> 32:57.530
engraved in my mind.

32:57.640 --> 32:58.110
Cheers.

32:58.400 --> 32:58.920
Cheers.

32:59.110 --> 32:59.680
Cheers.

33:09.680 --> 33:10.350
I've tasted

33:10.400 --> 33:11.910
many kinds of fruit wine.

33:12.110 --> 33:13.570
But what I'm drinking now—

33:13.680 --> 33:14.750
so fruity and not sour at all—

33:14.750 --> 33:15.610
is rarely seen.

33:16.110 --> 33:17.710
It's a pity that we can't wait

33:18.160 --> 33:19.440
till Mr. Li comes back to enjoy

33:19.440 --> 33:20.620
such good wine together.

33:20.620 --> 33:21.860
Silly you.

33:22.680 --> 33:23.630
This wine

33:23.880 --> 33:25.380
belongs to Mr. Li.

33:25.920 --> 33:26.830
He got it as a gift

33:26.830 --> 33:27.960
from some French merchants

33:27.960 --> 33:28.590
during a delivery

33:28.590 --> 33:30.050
of tea leaves to Xinjiang.

33:30.110 --> 33:31.730
The merchants
planned to buy a piece of land

33:31.730 --> 33:33.910
in Turpan to grow grapes and make wine.

33:34.480 --> 33:36.240
These few jars are samples.

33:36.310 --> 33:37.710
Drink as much as you like.

33:37.960 --> 33:38.680
Mr. Gu,

33:39.160 --> 33:40.070
do you know

33:40.070 --> 33:42.200
why we invited you over from Shanghai?

33:43.680 --> 33:44.240
Why?

33:44.790 --> 33:46.750
We provided some assistance
with the matter

33:46.750 --> 33:48.350
concerning Anhui tea merchants.

33:48.350 --> 33:49.200
In return,

33:49.480 --> 33:51.270
you helped us make a fortune.

33:51.920 --> 33:52.790
That said,

33:53.110 --> 33:54.510
as the Association Head,

33:54.960 --> 33:56.790
you're responsible to help us

33:57.510 --> 33:59.550
earn something else than money, right?

33:59.550 --> 34:00.110
Right.

34:00.590 --> 34:01.990
We're not short of money.

34:05.390 --> 34:07.070
It's not that easy
to be the Association Head.

34:07.070 --> 34:08.070
You have to be a role model

34:08.070 --> 34:09.800
in both character and conduct.

34:09.880 --> 34:10.540
Mr. Gu,

34:10.760 --> 34:12.270
you did one thing

34:12.800 --> 34:14.060
that I find admirable.

34:16.960 --> 34:17.960
What is it, Madam?

34:18.550 --> 34:20.280
I heard a marriage was arranged

34:20.550 --> 34:22.510
for you in Anhui when you were little.

34:22.510 --> 34:23.710
Then it was canceled.

34:23.880 --> 34:24.840
Later on, you met

34:24.880 --> 34:26.670
a girl from Shanxi, our hometown.

34:26.670 --> 34:28.070
Because of you, she has decided

34:28.070 --> 34:30.719
to remain single all her life
to take care of her father.

34:30.719 --> 34:31.960
This is not quite fair to her,

34:31.960 --> 34:33.530
a Shanxi fellow of ours?

34:33.880 --> 34:34.360
No.

34:34.440 --> 34:35.020
No...

34:35.110 --> 34:35.920
Is it true?

34:39.630 --> 34:40.679
Mr. Gu is young.

34:40.710 --> 34:41.670
He'd like to exude his charm elsewhere.

34:41.670 --> 34:43.400
This is not entirely his fault.

34:43.440 --> 34:44.230
Shut up.

34:45.550 --> 34:46.150
Do you think

34:46.150 --> 34:46.960
Mr. Gu is like you?

34:46.960 --> 34:48.190
You can't even keep count of

34:48.190 --> 34:48.670
your wives,

34:48.670 --> 34:49.590
children, and money!

34:49.590 --> 34:50.550
If he was like you,

34:50.550 --> 34:51.630
I would just ignore him.

34:51.630 --> 34:52.360
Mr. Gu,

34:52.480 --> 34:53.380
be a good man,

34:53.630 --> 34:54.920
and don't learn from him.

34:54.920 --> 34:55.840
Why are we suddenly

34:55.840 --> 34:57.000
talking about me now?

34:57.000 --> 34:57.630
I'll drink.

34:57.630 --> 34:59.150
You continue talking to him.

34:59.150 --> 34:59.800
Madam,

35:00.320 --> 35:01.980
the girl you're talking about

35:02.150 --> 35:03.550
is Chang Yu'er, right?

35:04.710 --> 35:05.430
She knows

35:05.960 --> 35:06.960
I was once engaged

35:06.960 --> 35:08.090
back in my hometown.

35:08.880 --> 35:10.740
But wasn't it canceled in the end?

35:11.000 --> 35:12.800
Why are you bringing it up again?

35:15.070 --> 35:16.680
It's perfectly normal

35:17.150 --> 35:21.480
for a man to take several wives
and concubines, right?

35:24.800 --> 35:26.600
Say it again. I'd like to hear it.

35:26.840 --> 35:27.440
My love,

35:27.510 --> 35:28.550
I'm a bit drunk

35:28.590 --> 35:29.450
from that wine.

35:29.800 --> 35:31.070
It has got in my head.

35:31.090 --> 35:31.800
Dizzy.

35:31.880 --> 35:34.070
I heard this Shanxi girl

35:34.090 --> 35:35.810
came from afar to save you.

35:35.920 --> 35:37.550
She's deeply in love with you.

35:37.550 --> 35:39.350
What exactly are you going to do?

35:43.800 --> 35:44.660
Say something.

35:45.400 --> 35:47.860
What do you think you are,
a piece of ginseng?

35:48.360 --> 35:49.420
I will treat her...

35:50.630 --> 35:51.510
with proper etiquette.

35:51.510 --> 35:52.000
Bah!

35:52.400 --> 35:53.510
What proper etiquette?

35:53.510 --> 35:54.840
Don't you feel guilty at all?

35:54.840 --> 35:55.550
Why did you voluntarily

35:55.550 --> 35:56.070
risk your life

35:56.070 --> 35:57.270
to save her father's?

35:57.360 --> 35:58.890
Her father is my lifesaver.

35:59.320 --> 36:00.510
Do you think you're keeping accounts

36:00.510 --> 36:01.550
here as a businessman,

36:01.550 --> 36:03.010
noting each transaction clearly?

36:03.010 --> 36:03.840
My silly friend,

36:03.840 --> 36:04.480
things

36:04.550 --> 36:07.590
between men and women
are inextricable tangles in nature.

36:07.590 --> 36:09.130
How can they be sorted out?

36:10.230 --> 36:11.360
What's on your mind?

36:11.510 --> 36:12.850
Do you have a plan?

36:14.480 --> 36:16.000
It's been a long enough time.

36:16.000 --> 36:18.130
How much longer do you want to stall it?

36:25.000 --> 36:26.600
I'm running out of patience.

36:27.190 --> 36:28.760
Look at my friend Mr. Gu here.

36:28.760 --> 36:31.110
He survived the attacks of people

36:31.400 --> 36:33.740
and wolves in Ningguta.

36:35.030 --> 36:37.110
Yet when it comes to his marriage...

36:38.150 --> 36:39.480
Are you unable to speak now?

36:39.480 --> 36:40.030
No.

36:40.510 --> 36:41.440
I'm afraid that she doesn't

36:41.440 --> 36:42.550
think I'm good enough.

36:42.550 --> 36:44.280
You're indeed not good enough.

36:46.710 --> 36:47.540
Madam,

36:48.070 --> 36:49.470
when I parted with Yu'er,

36:49.550 --> 36:51.610
she knew I was going back to Anhui

36:51.690 --> 36:52.890
to marry the girl

36:53.280 --> 36:54.880
I was engaged to at that time.

36:54.960 --> 36:55.590
But that girl

36:55.590 --> 36:57.070
married someone else in the end.

36:57.070 --> 36:58.070
If, at this moment,

36:58.070 --> 36:59.790
I go back to Yu'er,

36:59.920 --> 37:01.050
what will she think?

37:01.070 --> 37:01.760
Won't she think

37:01.760 --> 37:03.010
I don't cherish her enough?

37:03.010 --> 37:04.000
What right did I have

37:04.000 --> 37:05.330
to make her wait so long?

37:05.670 --> 37:06.310
Besides,

37:06.510 --> 37:07.280
if one day

37:07.280 --> 37:08.190
I'm forced to revert

37:08.190 --> 37:09.440
to my old life of harship,

37:09.440 --> 37:10.840
how will that leave her?

37:14.280 --> 37:15.490
However,

37:15.880 --> 37:17.870
you can't keep

37:17.960 --> 37:20.280
Miss Chang waiting

37:20.630 --> 37:22.360
forever for you.

37:23.590 --> 37:24.670
That's right.

37:26.070 --> 37:27.640
Shouldn't we

37:27.710 --> 37:29.640
find a good husband

37:29.960 --> 37:32.390
for her?

37:33.630 --> 37:36.000
How sensible my husband is.

37:37.010 --> 37:38.540
The purpose of this meeting

37:38.720 --> 37:40.740
is getting a confirmation from you.

37:43.030 --> 37:44.030
I have actually found

37:44.030 --> 37:45.540
an eligible bachelor for Miss Chang.

37:45.540 --> 37:47.480
He can propose marriage to her tomorrow.

37:47.480 --> 37:48.040
Mr. Gu,

37:48.070 --> 37:49.030
just say a word,

37:50.000 --> 37:52.140
and we'll be there to help you.

37:52.480 --> 37:54.960
This long-standing problem
has been solved now.

37:54.960 --> 37:55.920
To Mr. Gu!

37:56.400 --> 37:57.800
This is what we should do.

37:58.030 --> 37:58.960
Hold on.

37:59.880 --> 38:01.070
Well, I...

38:01.800 --> 38:03.460
I don't think it's a good idea.

38:04.480 --> 38:05.810
How is it not a good idea?

38:06.960 --> 38:08.110
You've decided to treat her
with proper etiquette.

38:08.110 --> 38:08.920
You can't stop her

38:08.920 --> 38:10.150
from marrying someone else, can you?

38:10.150 --> 38:11.810
Aren't you being too selfish?

38:15.550 --> 38:17.280
What is it do you want?

38:26.070 --> 38:26.710
Alright.

38:27.480 --> 38:29.810
Today, we're gathered with good friends.

38:30.000 --> 38:30.760
Fine wine is on the table.

38:30.760 --> 38:31.550
Come on.

38:31.590 --> 38:32.510
Let's raise our glasses.

38:32.510 --> 38:33.000
Come on!

38:33.360 --> 38:34.450
Cheers to

38:34.480 --> 38:36.110
solving a big problem for Mr. Gu.

38:36.110 --> 38:36.570
Come on.

38:36.630 --> 38:37.480
Smell the wine.

38:37.480 --> 38:38.590
Drink up.

38:38.630 --> 38:39.690
-Come on.
-Come on.

38:39.710 --> 38:40.110
No, no, no!

38:40.110 --> 38:41.050
Wait a moment.

38:41.400 --> 38:43.060
Put this matter aside for now.

38:44.320 --> 38:45.850
I'll go meet her right away.

38:46.190 --> 38:47.320
I need to make things

38:47.590 --> 38:49.250
clear with her face-to-face.

38:50.150 --> 38:51.360
Such good wine.

38:51.400 --> 38:52.560
It really is.

38:52.920 --> 38:53.550
Come on.

38:53.550 --> 38:54.700
Would you like more?

38:54.920 --> 38:55.960
Come on.

38:56.590 --> 38:57.710
What do you think of the smell?

38:57.710 --> 38:58.640
Terrific.

39:01.920 --> 39:02.550
Madam,

39:04.030 --> 39:05.800
you've found a bachelor for her already?

39:05.800 --> 39:06.440
Is it true?

39:09.630 --> 39:10.710
He really needs

39:10.710 --> 39:11.510
a little push.

39:13.110 --> 39:14.370
His care for Miss Chang

39:14.550 --> 39:16.480
just threw him into a panic, right?

39:16.880 --> 39:18.030
We had no other choice

39:18.030 --> 39:19.210
but to push you.

39:19.630 --> 39:21.240
What else could we do?

39:21.320 --> 39:22.190
We're unable to trick you.

39:22.190 --> 39:22.720
Alright.

39:22.760 --> 39:23.560
It's settled.

39:23.590 --> 39:24.550
Sit down and drink.

39:24.550 --> 39:25.440
Let's go on with our talk.

39:25.440 --> 39:26.550
How is it a good time for drinks now?

39:26.550 --> 39:27.030
I...

39:27.440 --> 39:29.590
I'd better propose marriage to her now.

39:29.590 --> 39:31.390
But before that, I need to go back

39:31.550 --> 39:33.670
to Anhui and discuss it with my mother.

39:33.670 --> 39:35.070
I must get well prepared.

39:35.070 --> 39:36.760
I should get going right away.

39:37.230 --> 39:37.880
Great!

39:38.760 --> 39:39.820
This entire night,

39:39.840 --> 39:42.260
you've finally said one thing right.

39:42.480 --> 39:44.320
A horse carriage
has been prepared for you.

39:44.320 --> 39:46.030
Just set off when the city gate opens

39:46.030 --> 39:47.840
tomorrow morning,
and you'll be home within one day.

39:47.840 --> 39:48.760
When you get home,

39:48.760 --> 39:49.840
you'll have to

39:49.880 --> 39:51.010
depend on yourself.

39:51.360 --> 39:53.160
We've done what friends should.

39:53.400 --> 39:54.840
You're no longer a scholar.

39:54.840 --> 39:56.590
So free yourself of those

39:56.760 --> 39:58.280
silly dorks' principles,

39:58.320 --> 39:59.150
will you?

40:03.030 --> 40:03.670
Madam,

40:07.030 --> 40:08.590
thank you for the kind reminder.

40:08.590 --> 40:11.250
Or Yu'er and I would've
missed out on each other.

40:18.360 --> 40:18.960
Pingyuan,

40:19.190 --> 40:19.880
bad news!

40:20.230 --> 40:21.560
Mother wants to see you.

40:31.400 --> 40:31.960
Mother.

40:32.840 --> 40:33.570
You're back.

40:34.550 --> 40:36.630
I heard you hurriedly rush in.

40:37.320 --> 40:38.840
Pingwen told me there was bad news.

40:38.840 --> 40:40.100
That really scared me.

40:40.710 --> 40:41.730
Where is Ms. Bai?

40:42.000 --> 40:42.900
What Ms. Bai?

40:43.320 --> 40:43.920
Mother,

40:44.230 --> 40:44.960
I mean Yimei.

40:50.650 --> 40:52.010
She woke up and left.

40:53.800 --> 40:55.600
I couldn't persuade her to stay.

40:56.480 --> 40:57.440
She told us

40:59.230 --> 41:01.070
not to mention her name anymore,

41:02.440 --> 41:04.400
or our family might get in trouble.

41:05.280 --> 41:07.800
Ms. Bai no longer exists in the world.

41:11.150 --> 41:12.230
How could we let her

41:12.840 --> 41:13.760
leave alone?

41:14.400 --> 41:15.950
That was what she wanted.

41:16.110 --> 41:18.100
We can't make her stay.

41:18.150 --> 41:19.320
Just leave her be.

41:20.190 --> 41:21.450
I want to keep her here.

41:22.280 --> 41:22.960
It's not

41:22.980 --> 41:24.110
because I fancy her,

41:24.630 --> 41:26.290
but because I promised Mr. Bai

41:26.960 --> 41:28.490
to protect her all her life.

41:29.840 --> 41:31.240
Just like that, she left.

41:31.590 --> 41:32.400
In this vast world,

41:32.400 --> 41:33.530
where can I find her?

41:37.510 --> 41:38.400
She left

41:39.360 --> 41:41.690
because she doesn't want to see you again.

41:43.360 --> 41:44.820
She'll absolutely object

41:44.880 --> 41:46.340
to getting married again,

41:47.480 --> 41:49.510
and even more to being a freeloader here,

41:49.510 --> 41:51.400
idling her time away and getting old.

41:51.400 --> 41:53.030
Don't you think?

41:54.030 --> 41:55.230
Just leave her be.

41:57.280 --> 41:59.070
It's time you learned to let go.

42:00.030 --> 42:02.550
All good things must come to an end.

42:06.840 --> 42:08.500
Let's go visit Mr. Bai's tomb.

42:13.550 --> 42:14.190
Mother,

42:14.800 --> 42:15.800
what did Yimei say

42:15.800 --> 42:16.840
when she left?

42:22.630 --> 42:24.570
She said
she refused to live under anyone's roof,

42:24.570 --> 42:28.790
[Mr. Bai Shi'an's Tomb]

42:25.880 --> 42:28.080
and that she would lead a life of her own.

42:39.840 --> 42:41.300
A weak woman though she is,

42:42.400 --> 42:43.860
she has more grit than I do.

42:46.880 --> 42:49.890
[Mr. Bai Shi'an's Tomb]

42:46.960 --> 42:47.590
Mr. Bai,

42:48.190 --> 42:49.320
you heard it, right?

42:50.510 --> 42:51.360
Don't worry.

42:52.550 --> 42:53.590
Yimei is a blessed girl.

42:53.590 --> 42:54.520
She will be fine.

42:56.000 --> 42:57.600
Mother and I are leaving now.

42:58.920 --> 43:00.650
When I get any news about Yimei,

43:01.760 --> 43:02.800
I'll visit your tomb again.
